Round 1: P0 critical fixes
- Fix deploy-all.sh: add deploy_relay_server, deploy_push_server, deploy_notify_server
- Fix check-health.sh: add health checks for relay, push, notify servers
- Fix iOS Package.swift path mismatch (Sources/CinaConnect → Sources/OnChainUX)
- Fix Bundler create_handle_ops_tx: real transaction signing
- Fix Polkadot SCALE codec: zero-dependency u128/Compact decoding, proper storage keys
- Fix TRON adapter: remove dead fetch call
- Port EIP-5792 to Vue composables (4 composables + tests)

Round 2: npm publish + execution paths
- npm publish pipeline (all 71 @cinaconnect/* packages already published)
- Swap SDK on-chain execution (Uniswap V3/V4, 1inch, 0x via viem WalletClient)
- AA SDK production wiring (bundler RPC, factory deployment, real signing)
- Cosmos chain adapter (bech32, Keplr, CosmWasm, 168 tests)
- EIP-5792 Svelte stores + Nuxt composables

Round 3: Feature completeness
- Sui chain adapter (BCS encoder, wallet support, 168 tests)
- Batch transaction on-chain execution (MultiSend contract, EIP-5792)
- Swap SDK approve flow + real quote fetching (EIP-2612 permit)
- Shamir's Secret Sharing (polynomial arithmetic, XChaCha20-Poly1305)
- Social login server-side validation (Google/Apple/Twitter, Twilio SMS)

Round 4: Final chain adapters + Unity
- NEAR chain adapter (Borsh, NEP-141/171, wallet selector)
- Starknet chain adapter (Cairo contracts, native AA, Braavos/Argent X)
- XRPL chain adapter (XRP transfers, IOU tokens, DEX, XLS-20 NFT)
- Hedera chain adapter (HAPI + EVM compat, HTS tokens, Mirror node)
- Unity .asmdef files + UPM package.json + push notifications

Round 5: Final audit + docs + demo
- Final audit report (analysis-v3/06-FINAL-AUDIT.md)
- Angular EIP-5792 service + standalone component migration
- Next.js Edge Runtime + server actions + SSR hooks
- React Native EIP-5792 + ENS + biometric auth + push
- Analytics ingestion server (Cloudflare Worker) + CDN deployment
- Demo app: 6 new pages (settings, activity, profile, tokens, components, AA)
