+## 📋 Executive Summary
+
+CinaConnect is a **complete, self-hosted, open-source Web3 SDK** designed as a full replacement for Reown AppKit (formerly WalletConnect/Web3Modal). It eliminates licensing restrictions, MAU caps, and infrastructure dependencies while providing equivalent — and in many areas superior — functionality.
