+| Issue | Solution |
+|-------|----------|
+| No wallets detected | Install a Bitcoin browser extension wallet |
+| Wrong network | Switch wallet to mainnet/testnet in wallet settings |
+| PSBT signing fails | Verify PSBT format matches wallet expectations |
